# Boot CI curated expansion, second round — suite-prefixed paths (suite/rel,
# no .c). The rest of the suite triaged on all three arches: every entry
# here builds against newlib + libgloss and passes honestly on bios,
# aarch64 and riscv64 (one of the suite's expected outcomes, or exit 0).
# What still fails or does not build is listed as deferred in
# packages/os-test/SUITES.md.

